{"_id":"WmProfession0001","img":"icons/tools/smithing/anvil.webp","name":"Blacksmithing","sort":10000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Blacksmithing Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Blacksmithing</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Quick Repair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Future subcategories</strong></p>\n<ol><li>Specialty I: To be determined by the GM.</li><li>Specialty II: To be determined by the GM.</li><li>Specialty III: To be determined by the GM.</li></ol>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:blacksmithing"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","selector":"blacksmithing-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","la